{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1779634812952,"sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"skill","callID":"019e5a80363e73ce7d42f5accab78bdf","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"name":"agent-workbench-toolbox-zh"},"output":"<skill_content name=\"agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\">\n# Skill: agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\n\n# Agent Workbench 工具箱（中文）\r\n\r\n把本 skill 作为 `agent_workbench` 驱动 STM32 仓库的底层工具适配层。它不替代功能、调试或测试 workflow；它只约束命令入口、证据读取、monitor 配置和失败路由。\r\n\r\n## 核心原则\r\n\r\n- 把 `agent_workbench` 当作主控制面。\r\n- 从仓库根目录运行命令；支持 `--json` 的命令必须加 `--json`。\r\n- PowerShell 一次只运行一条 workbench 命令，不用 `;`、`&&` 或管道串联 workbench 命令。\r\n- 先运行 `doctor --json`；有阻塞性 fail 时停止源码修改并报告。\r\n- 先读结构化 JSON 和 evidence，再从源码推断状态。\r\n- 不要复用示例项目路径、串口、ready banner、prompt、monitor item、寄存器地址或内存地址；全部来自当前项目的 `doctor`、配置、源码、ELF/map、CMSIS 头文件或 runtime evidence。\r\n- flash、reset、UART、diag 和 monitor 不需要用户授权；任务需要时直接运行，除非环境本身阻塞。\r\n\r\n## 第一条命令\r\n\r\n从仓库根目录开始：\r\n\r\n```powershell\r\n./agent_workbench/bin/agent_workbench.bat doctor --json\r\n```\r\n\r\n如果这是 launcher 或 PowerShell 解析问题导致失败，改用：\r\n\r\n```powershell\r\npython \".\\agent_workbench\\workbench.py\" doctor --json\r\n```\r\n\r\n仍失败再试：\r\n\r\n```powershell\r\npy -3 \".\\agent_workbench\\workbench.py\" doctor --json\r\n```\r\n\r\n然后根据 [references/command-matrix.md](references/command-matrix.md) 选择下一条命令。\r\n\r\n## 保留命令\r\n\r\n只使用这些公共命令：\r\n\r\n- `doctor --json`\r\n- `build --json`\r\n- `fix-build --json`\r\n- `flash --json`\r\n- `reset --json`\r\n- `uart exec --reset-first --json`\r\n- `uart exec --reset-first --expect-ready --json`\r\n- `diag exec --json`\r\n- `monitor start --json`\r\n- `monitor start --reset-first --json`\r\n- `monitor stop --json`\r\n- `monitor stats --json`\r\n\r\n## 按需读取\r\n\r\n只读取当前工作需要的 reference：\r\n\r\n- 命令选择、调用模板、关键 JSON 字段：[references/command-matrix.md](references/command-matrix.md)\r\n- PowerShell 稳定执行规则：[references/command-execution.md](references/command-execution.md)\r\n- runtime、evidence、generated 产物地图：[references/artifact-map.md](references/artifact-map.md)\r\n- 失败类型到下一步动作的路由：[references/failure-routing.md](references/failure-routing.md)\r\n- monitor 变量、寄存器、地址自动配置：[references/monitor-configuration.md](references/monitor-configuration.md)\r\n- Windows / PowerShell 安全调用规则：[references/powershell-safe.md](references/powershell-safe.md)\r\n- workflow 编排规则：[references/workflow-orchestration.md](references/workflow-orchestration.md)\r\n- 实机验证门槛：[references/hardware-verification.md](references/hardware-verification.md)\r\n\r\n## 协作规则\r\n\r\n- 功能开发：组合 `agent-workbench-toolbox-zh` + `agent-workbench-feature-zh`。\r\n- 自动调试：组合 `agent-workbench-toolbox-zh` + `agent-workbench-debug-zh`。\r\n- 测试设计与验证：组合 `agent-workbench-toolbox-zh` + `agent-workbench-test-zh`。\r\n\r\nworkflow skill 不重复解释全部命令细节，应复用本 skill 的 command、monitor、artifact 和 failure reference。\r\n\r\n不确定该搭配哪个 workflow skill 时，读取 [references/workflow-orchestration.md](references/workflow-orchestration.md)。\r\n\r\n## 完成报告底线\r\n\r\n最终报告只引用真实执行过的命令和真实 artifact。列出每条 workbench 命令的 `exit_code`、关键结论和 artifact 路径；未执行的实机验证写明“未执行”或具体阻塞原因。\n\nBase directory for this skill: file:///C:/Users/Administrator/.config/opencode/skills/agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\nNote: file list is sampled.\n\n<skill_files>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\workflow-orchestration.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\powershell-safe.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\monitor-configuration.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\hardware-verification.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\failure-routing.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\command-matrix.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\command-execution.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\references\\artifact-map.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh\\agents\\openai.yaml</file>\n</skill_files>\n</skill_content>","metadata":{"name":"agent-workbench-toolbox-zh","dir":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-toolbox-zh","truncated":false},"title":"Loaded skill: agent-workbench-toolbox-zh","time":{"start":1779634812882,"end":1779634812950}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"用户要求写一个通过主循环来实现红灯闪烁的CLI指令，0.5ms闪烁一次。\n\n这是一个STM32项目，用户想要：\n1. 添加一个新的CLI指令\n2. 该指令控制红灯闪烁\n3. 通过主循环实现（不是定时器中断）\n4. 闪烁频率：0.5ms一次\n\n根据AGENTS.md和agent-workbench-feature-zh skill的描述，这应该使用feature skill来处理。\n\n首先我需要：\n1. 加载 agent-workbench-toolbox-zh 和 agent-workbench-feature-zh skills\n2. 运行 doctor --json 检查环境\n3. 查看当前源码，了解CLI结构、GPIO配置等\n4. 实现功能\n5. build\n6. flash\n7. 验证\n\n让我先加载必要的skills。","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_e5a80371e001Y9tUdHPBIxS3OW","sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","messageID":"msg_e5a801a52001Wf6O7YcJtGgs5R"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1779634813109,"sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"skill","callID":"019e5a8037124dbc6e92ddb87f5344f9","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"name":"agent-workbench-feature-zh"},"output":"<skill_content name=\"agent-workbench-feature-zh\">\n# Skill: agent-workbench-feature-zh\n\n# Agent Workbench 功能开发（中文）\n\n用户要求新增、修改或验证固件行为时使用本 workflow：外设、CLI 命令、协议、状态逻辑、控制环路、状态上报，或“实现并验证”类工作。始终与 `agent-workbench-toolbox-zh` 配合使用。\n\n## 功能开发流程\n\n1. 运行 `doctor --json`，阻塞性失败先报告。\n2. 读取当前 `agent_workbench/agent_workbench.yaml`、README/配置、相关源码、生成头文件、linker/map、ELF symbols 和已有 runtime artifacts。\n3. 从当前项目确认 ready banner、prompt、CLI 命令、source dirs、artifact、串口、flash 方法和 monitor/remote-dt 可用性；不要复用示例值。\n4. 把需求拆成控制入口、状态变化、硬件资源、可观测证据和回归风险。\n5. 做最小且完整的固件修改；生成代码优先在 USER CODE 或项目已采用的安全区域修改。\n6. 运行 `build --json`；普通编译/链接失败才运行 `fix-build --json`，最多 3 轮。\n7. 需要板上证据时运行 `flash --json`，必要时 `reset --json`。\n8. 用 `uart exec --reset-first --expect-ready --json` 或 `diag exec --json` 验证用户可见行为。\n9. 需要内部状态、寄存器、计数器或趋势证据时，自动修改 monitor YAML，运行 `monitor start` -> 触发行为 -> `monitor stop` -> `monitor stats`。\n10. 需要远端 Linux/覆盖率/远程设备测试时，运行相应 `remote-dt ... --json`。\n11. 按 [references/feature-report-template.md](references/feature-report-template.md) 输出功能报告。\n\n## 按需读取\n\n- 标准开发路径：[references/feature-flow.md](references/feature-flow.md)\n- 实现方法论：[references/feature-development-methodology.md](references/feature-development-methodology.md)\n- 验收模式：[references/feature-acceptance-patterns.md](references/feature-acceptance-patterns.md)\n- 报告模板：[references/feature-report-template.md](references/feature-report-template.md)\n- monitor 配置：`agent-workbench-toolbox-zh/references/monitor-configuration.md`\n\n## 完成标准\n\n功能不是 build 通过就完成。最终报告必须说明：\n\n- 修改了什么。\n- 为什么修改匹配当前项目的硬件和软件结构。\n- build 是否通过。\n- 是否通过 UART/diag/monitor/remote-dt 获得合适证据。\n- 涉及 CLI 时 ready/prompt 和命令响应是否稳定。\n- 涉及内部状态时是否有 monitor 样本或明确阻塞原因。\n- 剩余风险和精确 evidence 路径。\n\nBase directory for this skill: file:///C:/Users/Administrator/.config/opencode/skills/agent-workbench-feature-zh\nRelative paths in this skill (e.g., scripts/, reference/) are relative to this base directory.\nNote: file list is sampled.\n\n<skill_files>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-report-template.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-flow.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-development-methodology.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\references\\feature-acceptance-patterns.md</file>\n<file>C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh\\agents\\openai.yaml</file>\n</skill_files>\n</skill_content>","metadata":{"name":"agent-workbench-feature-zh","dir":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.config\\opencode\\skills\\agent-workbench-feature-zh","truncated":false},"title":"Loaded skill: agent-workbench-feature-zh","time":{"start":1779634813048,"end":1779634813108}},"id":"prt_e5a8037ee001XZ5FuZLpdzSyo5","sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","messageID":"msg_e5a801a52001Wf6O7YcJtGgs5R"}}
