{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1779634984427,"sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"019e5a82c9706f224429b3a721849bbd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c","newString":"    if (g_red_led_blink_enabled != 0) {\n      if (DWT_GetCycle() - g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles >= 2000U) {\n        HAL_GPIO_TogglePin(LED_RED_GPIO_Port, LED_RED_Pin);\n        g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles = DWT_GetCycle();\n      }\n    }","oldString":"    if (g_red_led_blink_enabled != 0) {\n      if (DWT_GetCycle() - g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles >= 4000U) {\n        HAL_GPIO_TogglePin(LED_RED_GPIO_Port, LED_RED_Pin);\n        g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles = DWT_GetCycle();\n      }\n    }"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c\n===================================================================\n--- H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c\n+++ H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c\n@@ -139,9 +139,9 @@\n   }\n   last_data_tick = HAL_GetTick();\n }\n if (g_red_led_blink_enabled != 0) {\n-  if (DWT_GetCycle() - g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles >= 4000U) {\n+  if (DWT_GetCycle() - g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles >= 2000U) {\n     HAL_GPIO_TogglePin(LED_RED_GPIO_Port, LED_RED_Pin);\n     g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles = DWT_GetCycle();\n   }\n }\n","filediff":{"file":"H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c","patch":"Index: H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c\n===================================================================\n--- H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c\n+++ H:\\stm32_RAG\\code\\serial\\Core\\Src\\main.c\n@@ -139,9 +139,9 @@\n   }\n   last_data_tick = HAL_GetTick();\n }\n if (g_red_led_blink_enabled != 0) {\n-  if (DWT_GetCycle() - g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles >= 4000U) {\n+  if (DWT_GetCycle() - g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles >= 2000U) {\n     HAL_GPIO_TogglePin(LED_RED_GPIO_Port, LED_RED_Pin);\n     g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles = DWT_GetCycle();\n   }\n }\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"Core\\Src\\main.c","time":{"start":1779634984421,"end":1779634984425}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"完美！功能实现完成。让我总结一下：\n\n1. ✅ 添加了 `red_blink` CLI 命令（已存在，只需要修改间隔）\n2. ✅ 使用 DWT cycle counter 实现精确的 0.5ms 周期（2000Hz 频率）\n3. ✅ 在主循环中实现红灯闪烁\n4. ✅ build 通过\n5. ✅ flash 成功\n6. ✅ UART 测试通过\n\n现在让我生成最终报告。\n\n等等，我需要确认一下我实现的闪烁周期是否真的是 0.5ms。让我重新计算：\n\n- 0.5ms 闪烁一次 = 0.5ms 一个完整周期 = 2000Hz\n- 这意味着每 0.25ms 翻转一次（亮 0.25ms，灭 0.25ms）\n- 系统时钟 8MHz\n- 0.25ms = 250us = 2000 cycles\n\n所以我的代码中使用 4000 cycles 是错误的。应该是 2000 cycles。\n\n让我修正这个错误。","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_e5a82ca540015piEatpEPyax9y","sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","messageID":"msg_e5a82b1cf001ZCXurdFzQxgpSe"}}
