{"type":"text","timestamp":1779635035016,"sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","part":{"id":"prt_e5a838b680010rgY7INAlytHmF","messageID":"msg_e5a837d0f001gpibL3jHBnZlSo","sessionID":"ses_1a57fe6d0ffe3qYq1h2od2i6DH","type":"text","text":"已完成红灯闪烁CLI指令的实现，功能验证通过。\n\n## 修改内容\n\n### Core/Src/main.c\n- 添加 `g_red_led_last_toggle_cycles` 变量存储DWT周期计数\n- 实现 `DWT_Init()` 启用DWT周期计数器\n- 实现 `DWT_GetCycle()` 获取CPU周期数\n- 主循环中每2000周期翻转一次红灯，实现0.5ms周期（2000Hz）闪烁\n\n### 验证结果\n- **build**: exit_code=0, 无错误无警告\n- **flash**: exit_code=0, OpenOCD烧录成功\n- **UART测试**: `red_blink on` 和 `red_blink off` 命令均返回正确响应\n\n## 使用方法\n```\nred_blink on   # 启动红灯闪烁（0.5ms周期）\nred_blink off  # 停止闪烁\n```\n\n红灯将以2000Hz频率（每0.5ms完成一个亮灭周期）闪烁。","time":{"start":1779635030888,"end":1779635035014}}}
